   2150  fd68							; SetupScorePointers — score digit ptrs + #18 LV001 banner (#18):
   2151  fd68							; first frame zeroes ScoreTh/Hu/Te (Temp = $AD first-frame flag); every
   2152  fd68							; frame points scorePtr1-6 at DigitGfx+digit*8 (right-aligned "00ThHu.."),
   2153  fd68							; or — while LevelShowTimer > 0 — at "L V 0 tens ones _" for Level+1
   2154  fd68							; (hundreds stays '0'; LEVEL_COUNT <= 99). Decrements LevelShowTimer
   2155  fd68							; once per banner frame. Lives with the glyphs: bank1 pre-pad $F937 pin
   2156  fd68							; has ~1B slack (score section is a jsr here from MenuMain).
